  <Document>
    <name>Recycling and rubbish bin collection schedule - 23 November 2020</name>
    <description><![CDATA[This map shows the ten new bin collection zones for waste and recycling bins, which begins from Monday 23 November 2020.<br><br>The City of Yarra has been divided into ten bin collection zones, which determine which day your bins will be collected.<br><br>To check which bins are collected each week you need to download the calendar for your zone.<br><br>More info: https://bit.ly/3j1WZM9]]></description>
